+        /// START/END id non-zero, a START's extLen >= 27; anything else is ActExtReadBad. A bad or unknown extension leaves HasExt
+        /// false and the 46-byte fields untouched: it never fails the frame. A foreign byte 46 (or a 46-byte frame) is no
